  "snp3.6:16.1": "The Commentary allows <i lang='pi' translate='no'>kappa</i> in the sense of both “mental activity” and “eon” here. The context in this verse suggests it is about the eons of transmigration. ",
  "snp3.6:16.2": "",
  "snp3.6:16.3": "",
  "snp3.6:16.4": "",
  "snp3.6:17.1": "",
  "snp3.6:18.1": "",
