  "snp3.6:19.2": "",
  "snp3.6:19.3": "",
  "snp3.6:19.4": "",
  "snp3.6:19.5": "Commentary glosses <i lang='pi' translate='no'>brahmā</i> with <i lang='pi' translate='no'>brāhmaṇa</i>, which is required by the sense. ",
  "snp3.6:20.1": "",
  "snp3.6:20.2": "",
  "snp3.6:20.3": "",
