  "snp3.6:43.4": "",
  "snp3.6:44.1": "",
  "snp3.6:44.2": "",
  "snp3.6:44.3": "",
  "snp3.6:44.4": "Oddly, at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an5.38/en/sujato#5.4'>AN 5.38:5.4</a> we find <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sorata</i> with <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sakhila</i> in a similar sense to <i lang='pi' translate='no'>akhila</i> here. ",
