  "snp3.6:50.3": "Read <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sīhosi</i> (“you are a lion”) as at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/snp3.7/en/sujato#41.3'>Snp 3.7:41.3</a>. But <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn92/en/sujato#28.12'>MN 92:28.12</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag16.6/en/sujato#23.3'>Thag 16.6:23.3</a> have <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sīhova</i> (“like a lion”). ",
